# UE Agent frontend rules

Read `@docs/standards/02-前端视觉设计系统.md`, `@docs/standards/03-页面布局与交互规范.md`, `@docs/standards/04-CSS与样式文件规范.md`, and `@docs/standards/06-前端验收检查表.md`.

- Use the existing `packages/ui` component or compose existing components before adding a new one.
- Use shadcn/ui + Radix, Tailwind v4 semantic tokens, and Tabler Icons only.
- Do not introduce competing UI, icon, form, table, chart, date, or toast libraries.
- Do not hardcode brand colors, radii, shadows, z-index, or page-specific global CSS.
- Implement complete async and form states, including stale UE results after input changes.
- Do not guess business values or let LLM output enter the authoritative calculation path.
- Run the applicable checks and report actual evidence before claiming completion.

